# lights.vlog: awake_secs=50400; Sleep fires there. Turning the lights off
# promptly pauses hunger/happiness and clears sleepy; sleep_secs=36000
# later, Wake fires and gives the health bonus. The pet becomes a Child at
# hatch+1h (Phase 4), so care visits every 75 min (a meal, then a clean)
# keep it fed and keep poop-driven sickness from ever being scheduled;
# both are refused once asleep, so this has to happen in advance.
